melody:
# Verse 1
Oh Shen-an-doah, I long to see you,
A3 D4/ D4/ D4. E4/ F#4/ G4/ B4(2) A4
a-way, you roll-ing ri-ver,
D5/ C#5/ ~B4(2) ~B4/ A4/ B4/ A4/ F#4/ A4(2) r/
Oh Shen-an-doah, I long to see you,
A4 B4/ B4/ B4. F#4/ A4/ F#4/ E4 D4. r/
a-way, I'm bound a-way, 'cross the wide Mis-sou-ri.
D4/ E4/ ~F#4(2) ~F#4/ D4/ F#4/ B4/ A4 D4/ E4/ F#4. D4/ E4 D4(2)

# Verse 2
Oh Shen-an-doah, I love your daugh-ter,
A3 D4/ D4/ D4. E4/ F#4/ G4/ B4(2) A4
a-way, you roll-ing ri-ver,
D5/ C#5/ ~B4(2) ~B4/ A4/ B4/ A4/ F#4/ A4(2) r/
for her I'd cross your roam-ing wa-ters,
A4 B4/ B4/ B4. F#4/ A4/ F#4/ E4 D4. r/
a-way, I'm bound a-way, 'cross the wide Mis-sou-ri.
D4/ E4/ ~F#4(2) ~F#4/ D4/ F#4/ B4/ A4 D4/ E4/ F#4. D4/ E4 D4(3)
